  "findings": [
    "Exact standard blue ARA7604V3T1 is the standard V3, not the ARA7704V3 EXB. Horizon’s included and required lists distinguish radio cells from the separately required drive pack and charger.",
    "2S and 3S packs appear only as pairs in the vehicle’s requirements. The supplied body graphic and manual cover supported arrangements.",
    "Owner’s manual p.19 specifies 14.8–22.2 V total, 5000 mAh / 50C minimum and 5000 mAh / 100C recommended. The SLT3 control diagram p.21 shows the 50/75/100 limiter."
